                                "sense_id": "fc1cb2a5-4250-3f0a-88a1-e4f0711a780f",
                                "text": "In addition he should announce that the so-called \"tactical Trident\", where some missiles carrying only one warhead for use in regional wars, will no longer be deployed – that Britain considers nuclear weapons only as a strategic deterrent against the use of nuclear forces, not as a warfighting weapon."
