                                "sense_id": "fc1cb2a5-4250-3f0a-88a1-e4f0711a780f",
                                "text": "He [Pete Hegseth] added that any general involved with D.E.I. efforts should be fired. “Either you’re in for warfighting, and that’s it,” he said. “That’s the only litmus test we care about.”"
